### Minimal version (if you already have a `MapLibreMap` and `Style`)

If you’re inside a callback where you already have a `style` object (e.g. after `style = mapboxMap.getStyle { … }`), the core two‑line logic is:

```kotlin
// 1️⃣ Add the DEM source
style.addSource(RasterDemSource("dem", "https://example.com/terrain.json"))

// 2️⃣ Enable terrain with 1.5× exaggeration
style.setTerrain(Terrain("dem").apply { exaggeration(1.5f) })
```

That’s the exact analogue of the two JavaScript calls you posted. 🎉

